<codeline><highlight class="normal"><sp/><sp/>-<sp/><sp/>Hardware<sp/>Control<sp/>=<sp/>None</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">-<sp/><sp/>The<sp/>program<sp/>will<sp/>print<sp/>out<sp/>three<sp/>sentences:<sp/>one<sp/>to<sp/>the<sp/>SCIA,<sp/>one<sp/>to<sp/>CCS,<sp/>and<sp/>a<sp/>final<sp/>one<sp/>to<sp/>SCIA.</highlight></codeline>
